+### Friends, Sharing, and Trading
+
+Multi-user mode only. Everything is private until its owner chooses; privacy is enforced here, not by clients. See
+[`FRIENDS.md`](FRIENDS.md) for the rules, the older routes they apply to, and the response shapes.
+
+| Method | Path | Notes |
+|--------|------|-------|
+| GET | `/api/friends/me` | Your invite code, sharing levels, and counts; also how a client detects the feature |
+| PUT | `/api/friends/me/sharing` | Choose Private, Friends, or Public for Collection, Wishlist, and For Trade independently |
+| POST | `/api/friends/me/invite-code` | Replace your invite code |
+| GET | `/api/friends/` | Friends and pending requests |
+| POST | `/api/friends/requests` | Ask a user to be friends by username or invite code |
+| POST | `/api/friends/requests/{request_id}/accept` | Accept a request made to you |
+| POST | `/api/friends/requests/{request_id}/decline` | Decline a request made to you |
+| DELETE | `/api/friends/requests/{request_id}` | Cancel your own request |
+| DELETE | `/api/friends/{user_id}` | End a friendship |
+| GET | `/api/friends/trade-list` | Your collection rows marked For Trade |
+| PUT | `/api/friends/trade-list/{collection_item_id}` | Mark some copies of a collection row For Trade (0 removes) |
+| DELETE | `/api/friends/trade-list/{collection_item_id}` | Take a row off your For Trade list |
+| GET | `/api/friends/{user_id}/profile` | Who they are to you and which sections you may open |
+| GET | `/api/friends/{user_id}/collection` | Their shared collection |
+| GET | `/api/friends/{user_id}/wishlist` | Their shared wishlist |
+| GET | `/api/friends/{user_id}/trade-list` | Their For Trade cards |
+| GET | `/api/friends/{user_id}/trade-match` | They have / you want and you have / they want |
+
 ### Pokédex, Profiles, and Public Sharing
 
 | Method | Path | Notes |
